  "verdict": "allowed",
  "section": "34",
  "quote": "The tenant is responsible for the repair of undue damage to the rental unit or residential complex caused by the wilful or negligent conduct of the tenant, another occupant of the rental unit or a person permitted in the residential complex by the tenant.",
  "reason": "Section 34 explicitly makes the tenant responsible for repairing undue damage caused by the tenant's negligent (careless) conduct. Since the clause does not prohibit pets and aligns with the tenant's statutory responsibility under section 34, it is consistent with the Act and allowed."
}

